.TH RUN-DOCKER-LOCAL 1 "2026-08-31" "Mu2e Shift Scheduler v1.0.0" "Mu2e Shift Scheduler"
.SH NAME
run-docker-local.sh \- run the scheduler container locally
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ./scripts/run-docker-local.sh
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs the image built by
.BR build-docker (1)
locally with gunicorn on port 8000, mirroring the OKD deployment. Environment
variables such as \fBMU2E_INITIAL_ADMIN_PASSWORD\fR and
\fBSHOW_ADMIN_LOGIN\fR apply as they do for the OKD instance.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR build-docker (1),
.BR start-mu2e-shift-scheduler (1)
